+- Settings that cost you money ----------------------------------------------+
| CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1 turns off the free server-side     |
| check in auto mode, so Claude Code sends its own classifier requests and    |
| you pay for them.                                                           |
|   Set in: your user settings, ~/.claude/settings.json                       |
|   Cost: about $249.52 over the last 30 days (6,016 requests)                |
|         also, classifier stage 2 (probably): $3.50, 12 requests, not added  |
|         to the figure above                                                 |
|   Fix: remove it. Do not add CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_MODE_SERVER: the default      |
|   already asks the server. Takes effect at the next Claude Code session.    |
|   Risk: A gateway that rejects beta fields may return 400 errors. Claude    |
|   Code 2.1.304 and later retries some of them itself. If errors start, undo |
|   this and run /context-guru:doctor.                                        |
|   Also changes: Tool search halves the tools field (58.5 KB to 28.6 KB),    |
|   and context_management turns on.                                          |
|                                                                             |
| Session recap (awaySummaryEnabled) makes a model call for a one-line        |
| summary each time you come back after a few minutes away.                   |
|   Set in: not set anywhere (on by default)                                  |
|   Cost: not measured yet                                                    |
|   Fix: set "awaySummaryEnabled": false. Takes effect at the next Claude     |
|   Code session.                                                             |
|   Risk: You no longer see the recap line when you come back.                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
Apply it? Say yes, or run: /context-guru:save-more apply settings disable-experimental-betas
Apply it? Say yes, or run: /context-guru:save-more apply settings session-recap
